e time of the shared event, plus a stru",
  "text_tail": "s it as Site 7 being meaningfully wetter. With the qualifier, the cell reads \"0.9 mm/h ± 1.06 mm/h — Δ WITHIN UNCERTAINTY\" and the planner correctly treats the divergence as indistinguishable from zero.\n\nLet me write this in three or four concise sentences, matching the technical register of the conversation.\n</think>\n\nI adopt the shared-lineage gate and its suppressed-cell output verbatim; it converts a vendor-family or cadence-mismatch artifact into an explicitly inconclusive record that a year-three reader can parse as structurally unvalidated rather than as a failed comparison. The concrete design choice I advance: whenever the lineage gate passes and a numeric delta does print, the cell must simultaneously carry an uncertainty band equal to the root-sum-square of both sites' residual calibration uncertainties at the shared-event instant plus a fixed structural term of 0.3 mm/h for residual cadence-aliasing, and if the band's half-width meets or exceeds the delta magnitude the cell appends \"— Δ WITHIN UNCERTAINTY,\" so the comparison reports a number flagged as statistically indistinguishable from zero. The failure this qualifier closes: week 22, Site 7 (tipping-bucket, residual cal 0.8 mm/h) and Site 8 (rain gauge, residual cal 0.7 mm/h) jointly confirm the same cell thunderstorm and the comparison cell prints \"0.9 mm/h,\" a neighborhood drainage-planning meeting reads the figure as Site 7 being meaningfully wetter, and a catch-basin upsizing is scoped for Site 7's culvert based on a divergence whose true identity is the sum of two calibration residuals masking zero spatial signal. With the appended band the cell reads \"0.9 mm/h ± 1.06 mm/h — Δ WITHIN UNCERTAINTY,\" the drainage-planning committee correctly treats the divergence as unresolvable, defers the upsizing decision to the next confirmed shared event with tighter calibrations, and the record retains both the number and its nullification so the uncertainty budget is auditable rather than silently discarded.",
